#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`ds18x20` --- DS18x20 temperature sensor driver"
msgstr ":mod:`ds18x20` --- controlador del sensor de temperatura DS18x20"

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :mod:`ds18x20` module provides a driver for the Maxim/Dallas DS18B20, "
"DS18S20 and DS1822 1-Wire digital temperature sensors. It is built on top of"
" the :mod:`onewire` module and supports multiple sensors sharing a single "
"bus."
msgstr ""
"El módulo :mod:`ds18x20` proporciona un controlador para los sensores de "
"temperatura digitales 1-Wire DS18B20, DS18S20 y DS1822 de Maxim/Dallas. Está"
" construido sobre el módulo :mod:`onewire` y admite varios sensores "
"compartiendo un único bus."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:11
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Ejemplo::"

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:27
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Clases"

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:31
msgid ""
"Construct a DS18x20 driver bound to the given `onewire.OneWire` bus. "
"Multiple DS18x20 sensors may share the same bus."
msgstr ""
"Construye un controlador DS18x20 vinculado al bus `onewire.OneWire` dado. "
"Varios sensores DS18x20 pueden compartir el mismo bus."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:36
msgid ""
"Search the underlying 1-Wire bus and return a list of ROM codes that "
"correspond to DS18x20-family devices. Only ROMs whose family code is "
"``0x10`` (DS18S20), ``0x22`` (DS1822) or ``0x28`` (DS18B20) are returned; "
"other 1-Wire devices on the same bus are filtered out."
msgstr ""
"Busca en el bus 1-Wire subyacente y devuelve una lista de códigos ROM que "
"corresponden a dispositivos de la familia DS18x20. Solo se devuelven las ROM"
" cuyo código de familia es ``0x10`` (DS18S20), ``0x22`` (DS1822) o ``0x28`` "
"(DS18B20); otros dispositivos 1-Wire en el mismo bus se filtran."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:43
msgid ""
"Issue a temperature conversion command to **all** DS18x20 sensors on the bus"
" simultaneously (using SKIP ROM). After calling this method you must wait "
"for the conversion to complete (up to 750 ms at the default 12-bit "
"resolution) before calling :meth:`read_temp`."
msgstr ""
"Emite un comando de conversión de temperatura a **todos** los sensores "
"DS18x20 del bus simultáneamente (usando SKIP ROM). Después de llamar a este "
"método debes esperar a que se complete la conversión (hasta 750 ms con la "
"resolución por defecto de 12 bits) antes de llamar a :meth:`read_temp`."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:50
msgid ""
"Read the 9-byte scratchpad from the device addressed by *rom* and return it "
"as a ``bytearray``. The scratchpad CRC is verified; raises :exc:`Exception` "
"with the message ``\"CRC error\"`` on a CRC mismatch."
msgstr ""
"Lee el scratchpad de 9 bytes del dispositivo direccionado por *rom* y lo "
"devuelve como un ``bytearray``. Se verifica el CRC del scratchpad; lanza "
":exc:`Exception` con el mensaje ``\"CRC error\"`` en caso de discrepancia de"
" CRC."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:57
msgid ""
"The returned buffer is the driver's internal buffer and is overwritten by "
"subsequent calls."
msgstr ""
"El búfer devuelto es el búfer interno del controlador y se sobrescribe en "
"llamadas posteriores."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:62
msgid ""
"Write 3 bytes to the scratchpad of the device addressed by *rom*. *buf* must"
" contain the high alarm trigger (TH), low alarm trigger (TL) and "
"configuration register values."
msgstr ""
"Escribe 3 bytes en el scratchpad del dispositivo direccionado por *rom*. "
"*buf* debe contener los valores del disparador de alarma alta (TH), el "
"disparador de alarma baja (TL) y el registro de configuración."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:68
msgid ""
"Read the most recently converted temperature from the device addressed by "
"*rom* and return it in degrees Celsius as a ``float``. Handles both DS18S20 "
"(family code ``0x10``) and DS18B20 / DS1822 (family codes ``0x28`` / "
"``0x22``) encodings, including negative temperatures."
msgstr ""
"Lee la temperatura convertida más recientemente del dispositivo direccionado"
" por *rom* y la devuelve en grados Celsius como un ``float``. Maneja las "
"codificaciones tanto del DS18S20 (código de familia ``0x10``) como del "
"DS18B20 / DS1822 (códigos de familia ``0x28`` / ``0x22``), incluyendo "
"temperaturas negativas."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:74
msgid ""
"Call :meth:`convert_temp` and wait for the conversion to finish before "
"calling this method."
msgstr ""
"Llama a :meth:`convert_temp` y espera a que la conversión termine antes de "
"llamar a este método."
